<title>PAKISTAN: SQUASH-MEN'S WORLD OPEN FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-MEN'S WORLD OPEN FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the final of the men's</p>
<p>World Open squash championship on Friday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat 2-Rodney Eyles</p>
<p>(Australia) 15-13 17-15 11-15 15-3</p>
</text>
